# The County Budget Tracker — environment
#
# The app runs with none of these set. Without them it reads text-based PDFs, extracts budget rows,
# and answers questions by returning the matching source passages. Each variable below switches on
# one additional capability, and the Settings page shows which are active.

# --- AI answers -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Without this, questions still return the matching source passages, just not a written answer.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# --- OCR for scanned PDFs ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Image-based PDFs cannot be read without this. Uploads report that OCR configuration is required
# rather than returning empty figures. Use an OCR or Document OCR processor in Document AI.
GOOGLE_PROJECT_ID=
GOOGLE_LOCATION=us
GOOGLE_DOCUMENT_AI_PROCESSOR_ID=
# Path to a service account JSON file, or the JSON itself.
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=

# --- Storage ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Without DATABASE_URL, processed documents live in a local cache that clears on restart.
# See db/schema.sql for the tables.
DATABASE_URL=
# Bucket for archiving the original PDFs.
GCS_BUCKET=

# --- Administrator access ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paid operations — Document AI OCR, PDF archiving, and database writes — run only for callers who
# send this value as the x-admin-api-key header. Leave it unset and every caller is public, which
# keeps the app usable without credentials while preventing anonymous callers from spending quota.
ADMIN_API_KEY=
